// Screen fill with constant-folded color calculation
// This tests constant folding in a loop context

ClrDraw

// Use constant expressions for colors
color1 = 8 + 7    // 15 - white
color2 = 16 / 2   // 8 - gray
color3 = 1 << 2   // 4 - dark

For y = 0 To 100
    For x = 0 To 100
        PxlOn(x, y, color1)
    Next
Next

For y = 101 To 200
    For x = 0 To 100
        PxlOn(x, y, color2)
    Next
Next

Disp "Done!"
